es on a night arrival.","airport-arrival-guide","2026-10-05","/blog/antalya-airport-arrival-guide/","Arriving at Antalya Airport: what happens after you land","From wheels down to the vehicle door: terminals, passport control, the meeting point and what happens when the flight is late.","transfer-vs-taxi","/blog/antalya-airport-transfer-vs-taxi/","Private transfer, taxi or shared shuttle from Antalya Airport?","Three ways to leave Antalya Airport, three very different arrival experiences. Here is what each one costs, how long it takes and who it suits.",6,"koprulu-canyon-rafting","2026-09-27","/blog/koprulu-canyon-rafting-from-antalya/","Rafting in Köprülü Canyon","Cold green water, a Roman bridge and a pine-covered canyon. What to expect from a rafting day in Köprülü Canyon, and how to plan it from the coast.","antalya-in-spring","2026-09-26","/blog/things-to-do-in-antalya-in-spring/","Antalya in spring: what to do between March and May","Orange blossom in the streets, snow on the peaks and the sea warming week by week. Why spring is the season for active holidays around Antalya.","ramadan-bayram-antalya","2026-09-29","/blog/ramadan-and-eid-in-antalya/","Travelling to Antalya during Ramadan and Eid","In the resorts, daily life hardly changes during Ramadan. The holidays that follow are another story - here is what to expect and how to plan around them.","side-ancient-city-guide","/blog/side-ancient-city-guide/","Side: a guide to the ancient city","A Roman theatre, temple columns on the water's edge and a harbour town built inside the ancient walls. How to see Side at its best - out of season.","pamukkale-trip-from-antalya","/blog/pamukkale-trip-from-antalya/","Pamukkale from Antalya: how to plan the trip","White travertine terraces, a Roman city on the hill and a pool among ancient columns. How to visit Pamukkale from Antalya without spending the whole day in a coach.","saklikent-ski-antalya","/blog/skiing-near-antalya-saklikent/","Skiing near Antalya: the Saklıkent ski centre","Ski in the morning, walk by the sea in the afternoon. A practical guide to Saklıkent, Antalya's own ski centre, and how to get there from the coast.","belek-winter-golf","/blog/winter-golf-in-belek/","Winter golf in Belek","Mild days, green fairways and quieter tee sheets. What golfers should know about playing Belek between November and March, when home courses are closed.","cappadocia-winter-trip","/blog/cappadocia-in-winter-from-antalya/","Cappadocia in winter: a trip from Antalya","Fairy chimneys under snow and balloons over a white valley. How to combine a winter stay in Antalya with Cappadocia, and what the road is like in winter.",7,"medical-travel-antalya-winter","/blog/medical-travel-to-antalya-in-winter/","Medical and dental travel to Antalya in winter","Cooler weather, quieter hotels and easier scheduling. What people travelling to Antalya for treatment in winter should check and plan before they book.","wintering-in-antalya","/blog/wintering-in-antalya-long-stay-guide/","Spending the winter in Antalya: a guide for long stays","Weeks or months of mild weather instead of a northern winter. What long-stay visitors should know before spending the winter in Alanya, Side or Antalya.","alanya-in-winter","/blog/alanya-in-winter/","Alanya in winter","Mild days, an empty castle hill and a town that keeps living after the summer crowds leave. What Alanya is really like between November and March.","christmas-new-year-antalya","/blog/christmas-and-new-year-in-antalya/","Christmas and New Year in Antalya","Sunny days, a New Year's gala by the sea and the town of St Nicholas two and a half hours away. How to plan the holidays in Antalya, and how to get there on the night.","perge-aspendos-day-trip","/blog/perge-and-aspendos-day-trip/","Perge and Aspendos from Antalya","A colonnaded Roman street, a stadium for 12,000 and one of the best-preserved theatres of the ancient world, all within an hour of the airport.","antalya-in-autumn","/blog/things-to-do-in-antalya-in-autumn/","Antalya in autumn: what to do in October and November","The sea is still warm, the crowds have gone home and the heat has broken. Why October and November are the best-kept secret on the Turkish Riviera.","antalya-in-summer","2026-10-21","/blog/antalya-in-summer-july-august/","Antalya in summer: what July and August really feel like","Thirty-five degree afternoons, a sea at twenty-eight and the busiest arrivals hall of the year. What high season is like, and how to arrive without losing the first day.","belek-side-kemer-compare","/blog/belek-side-or-kemer-which-resort/","Belek, Side or Kemer: choosing your stretch of coast","Three resort areas, one airport, three very different holidays. Scenery, hotels, who each one suits and how long the drive from AYT really takes.","antalya-airport-terminals","/blog/antalya-airport-terminal-1-terminal-2/","Terminal 1, Terminal 2 or domestic: which one is yours","AYT has three terminals on one airport road. Here is how to tell which one your flight uses, how to cross between them and why your driver needs the flight number.","names",{"_6":581,"_672":581,"_668":581,"_666":853,"_664":581,"_662":854,"_660":855,"_630":856,"_650":581,"_646":581,"_648":857,"_644":858,"_642":581,"_640":581,"_638":859,"_636":860,"_634":581,"_632":581},"distanceKm",65,"durationMin",55,"duration",{"_6":827,"_672":834,"_668":835,"_666":836,"_664":837,"_662":838,"_660":839,"_658":837,"_656":840,"_652":841,"_654":842,"_630":843,"_650":844,"_646":845,"_648":846,"_644":847,"_642":848,"_640":849,"_638":850,"_636":851,"_634":845,"_632":852},"originalPrices",{"_828":832,"_830":833},"prices",{"_828":829,"_830":831},"slug","side","distance","65 km","durationLabel","55–65 minutes","vito",53,"sprinter",88,63,103,"55–65 Minuten","55–65 dakika","55–65 минут","55–65 minut","55–65 хвилин","55–65 منٹ","55–65 minuten","55–65 minuter","55–65 دقيقة","55–65分钟","55-65 minutter","55–65 minutos","55–65 λεπτά","55–65 דקות","55–65 perc","55–65 minuti","55〜65分"